    <string name="servers_hint">The app probes every address together and uses the fastest; when speeds are within 40 ms the one higher in the list wins. Long-press a row and drag to reorder. Dot: green = reachable, red = unreachable, grey = not tested. Addresses found on your LAN are added automatically. Include the port, e.g. http://192.168.1.20:8643.</string>
