    <string name="advdeleg_title">Advanced sub-agent routing</string>
    <string name="advdeleg_info">Chooses where this profile\'s sub-agents run. Default: the normal delegation model. Model routes: sub-agents can use the named model routes you define here; the default route is used when none is named. Profile routes: sub-agents hand work to the other profiles you check, and each description tells the model when to use that profile. Applies to new sessions. Sessions already running keep their routing.</string>
